PHASE 2 — Connect Your Workflow to Me (5 minutes)

You want to avoid pasting files manually.
Here’s how you do it:
1. You make changes in VS Code
Save normally.
2. You run this command in your repo root:
tree -L 3
3. You paste ONLY the tree output here
Not the files — just the structure.
4. I infer:
• What changed
• What’s missing
• What’s duplicated
• What needs correction
• Whether your logic is consistent
• Whether your modules are aligned
5. If you want deeper checks
You paste specific file names, and I ask you targeted questions:
• “Open modules/ingest.py and tell me the first 10 lines.”
• “Show me the header of your budget.csv.”
This keeps your workflow fast and secure.
Time required: 5 minutes
Outcome: You can command me to “check your work” anytime.

